# OnFailure 대상 — 소유자에게 평문 DM (실패 유닛·종료코드·journal 꼬리). DB/레플리카 미사용.
# %i = bot | digest-kr | digest-us | universe | kr-refresh | autopull
[Unit]
Description=AI-Investment-Bot owner alert for %i

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=ubuntu
WorkingDirectory=/home/ubuntu/AI-Investment-Bot
ExecStart=/home/ubuntu/AI-Investment-Bot/.venv/bin/python scripts/notify_owner.py --failed-unit %i
TimeoutStartSec=60
